@c ====================================================================
@node Overview
@chapter Overview

@cindex overview
@cindex id Tech 1
@value{PROJECT} is one Rust codebase, with no C in the tree.  It plays
every commercial id Tech 1 IWAD from @cite{Doom} to @cite{Final Doom}
and the free Freedoom IWADs.  The engine picks its game mode from the
IWAD it loads.  Fidelity is the product.  Vanilla demos shall play back
in sync and level statistics shall match Chocolate Doom, the reference
vanilla port.  This keeps the port honest: a behavioural difference
shows up as a failed test, not as a forum report.

The game logic is transliterated by hand from the GPL source release.
The platform, I/O, audio, and presentation layers are written as
idiomatic Rust from the start.  A software renderer, ported from the
original @file{r_*.c}, is the reference for how the game looks.  A
wgpu renderer with optional enhancements comes later and is checked
against that reference.  It never replaces it.

