@node Command Line
@section Command Line

@cindex command line
Vanilla single-dash arguments are accepted as written.  GNU-style long
forms are accepted alongside them.  @option{--help} and
@option{--version} follow @code{spacecraft-cli-standard}, and
@option{--version} carries the §15 attribution.

@table @code
@item -iwad @var{file}
Select IWAD.
@item -file @var{files@dots{}}
Load PWADs with vanilla override rules.
@item -deh @var{files@dots{}}
Load DeHackEd patches (M7).
@item -warp @var{e} @var{m}
@itemx -warp @var{map}
Start at a map.
@item -skill @var{1--5}
Skill level.
@item -nomonsters
@itemx -fast
@itemx -respawn
Gameplay switches.
@item -gameversion @var{v}
@code{1.9}, @code{ultimate}, @code{final}, @code{final2}.
@item -record @var{file}
@itemx -playdemo @var{file}
@itemx -timedemo @var{file}
Demo record, playback, benchmark.
@item -statdump @var{file}
Write level statistics in Chocolate Doom format.
@item -width
@itemx -height
