@itemx -window
Display.
@item -config @var{file}
Alternate configuration.
@end table

@cindex phobos-tools
@code{phobos-tools} is non-interactive and supports @option{--json}:
@code{wad ls}, @code{wad identify}, @code{demo check}, @code{demo diff},
@code{map stats}.  CI and agents use it.

@node Configuration
@section Configuration

@cindex configuration
TOML with sections @code{[video]}, @code{[audio]}, @code{[input]},
@code{[gameplay]}, @code{[compat]}, @code{[debug]}.  An unknown key is
warned about and ignored.  A missing or invalid value falls back to the
default with a warning.  A malformed file never stops the game from
starting.

@node Data Formats
@section Data Formats

@cindex demo format
@cindex savegame
WAD (IWAD, PWAD), vanilla demo @file{.lmp} (version byte 109 and the
earlier versions the selected game version implies), DeHackEd
@file{.deh} / @code{DEHACKED} lump (M7), Phobos native saves
(versioned), and optionally vanilla @file{.dsg} saves.  All are
untrusted input.

