@node Verification
@chapter Verification

@cindex verification
@cindex statcheck
Category D owes a smoke test (§21.2).  Fidelity is the product, so
Phobos sets a higher bar for itself.  This is a choice, not a Standard
obligation.

@multitable @columnfractions .22 .5 .28
@headitem Layer @tab Evidence @tab Runs in
@item Fixed point, tables, random
@tab Unit tests against values from the C source; property tests on
wrapping
@tab CI
@item WAD, map, patch, demo, save, DeHackEd parsers
@tab Unit tests plus @code{cargo-fuzz} targets; no panic, no unbounded
allocation
@tab CI (time-boxed fuzz)
@item Simulation
@tab Per-tic @code{World} checksum; golden traces for scripted sequences
(movement, doors, weapons, monsters)
@tab CI
@item Demo fidelity
@tab Built-in demos and a demo corpus: @code{-statdump} output compared
to Chocolate Doom built out of tree from a pinned commit (statcheck
method)
