@node Performance Targets
@section Performance Targets

@cindex performance targets
Category D has no §22 budget obligation.  These targets guide the work
and gate optimisation decisions.  The reference machine is still to be
chosen (OQ-3).

@multitable @columnfractions .65 .35
@headitem Measure @tab Target
@item Tic simulation, 99th percentile, MAP30 (Doom II) @tab @leq{} 1 ms
@item Software frame, 320x200 @tab @leq{} 1 ms
@item Software frame, 4x scale (1280x800) @tab @leq{} 6 ms
@item Map load, largest commercial map @tab @leq{} 250 ms
@item Resident memory, any commercial IWAD @tab @leq{} 256 MiB
@item Added input latency @tab No sleep beyond vsync and frame pacing
@end multitable

